      "content": "Create, retrieve, list, and cancel carbon-offset estimates without committing a purchase. An estimate quotes the equivalent carbon emissions (in grams) and the transaction cost (in USD cents) for a hypothetical activity — shipping, vehicle travel, flights, electricity consumption, direct carbon mass, or a fixed dollar amount — and returns a slug that can later be converted to a purchase against the matched offset source.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Cloverly Support",
